output_format.instructions:
Return the same BibTeX file, appending two new fields to each entry:
- relevance_rating={1|2|3|4|5}
- comment={Short one-line justification of your rating}
Preserve all original fields and formatting.

output_format.bibtex_example:
@article{doe2023,
  title={Machine Learning for Architecture Debt Detection},
  author={Doe, Jane and Smith, John},
  year={2023},
  journal={Journal of Software Engineering Research},
  keywords={technical debt, architecture debt, machine learning},
  relevance_rating={5},
  comment={Directly targets architecture debt detection with ML; aligns with RQ2 and RQ6.}
}
